\**{c=red:Note:}** This Mission is much easier if you purchase a {k:Map of Giddeus}.
=2 Walkthrough
!Giddeus-map1.jpg|right|Giddeus Map
* Accept the Mission from any {n:Gate Guard}.
** {n:Mokyokyo} - {z:Windurst Waters} (F-5)
** {n:Janshura-Rashura} - {z:Port Windurst} (B-5)
** {n:Rakoh Buuma} - {z:Windurst Woods} (K-10)
** {n:Zokima-Rokima} - {z:Windurst Walls} (H-7)
* Then make your way to the roof of the {p:Rhinostery} in {z:Windurst Waters} (J-8) (near {p:Home Point #3|Home Point}), it is located in the southern half of the zone.
** Speak with {n:Leepe-Hoppe} at (J-9) on the roof of the Rhinostery. He will give you the {@k} {k:Food offering} and {@k} {k:Drink offering}.
* Head out for {z:Giddeus}, which is located at (F-8) in {z:West Sarutabaruta}.
** If you previously unlocked it, you can teleport directly to (G-12) with {p:Home Point} #1 and make your way north from there.
* Make your way to (H-7) and speak to a {m:Yagudo} NPC named {n:Laa Mozi} to hand over the {@k} {k:Food offering}.
** You can reach this NPC by taking all left turns from the Sarutabaruta entrance.
* Next, head to (G-7) and speak to a {m:Yagudo} NPC called {n:Ghoo Pakya} to hand over the {@k} {k:Drink offering}.
** Return to the Sarutabaruta entrance and take all right turns to reach this NPC.
* Head back to the **Rhinostery**. As you climb the stairs to the roof, you'll receive another cutscene.
* Return to the {n:Gate Guard} to complete the Mission.

